{
  "uid": "drbd-replication",
  "title": "DRBD — réplication et auto-guérison",
  "description": "État de la réplication DRBD et verdicts du balayeur drbd-selfheal. Le seul chiffre fiable est out-of-sync, lu depuis le nœud qui porte le bitmap : ne jamais juger sur un pourcentage.",
  "tags": ["drbd", "piraeus", "stockage"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "resource",
        "label": "Volume",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(drbd_peerdevice_outofsync_bytes, name)", "refId": "resource" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "État instantané",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Paires divergentes",
      "description": "Paires dont le bitmap annonce des blocs non répliqués. Toute valeur non nulle mérite un regard : entre deux pairs UpToDate, c'est une divergence silencieuse que LINSTOR affiche en vert.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "count(drbd_peerdevice_outofsync_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"} > 0) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Volume divergent",
      "description": "Somme des bitmaps sales. out-of-sync est ASYMÉTRIQUE : chaque nœud tient le sien, cette somme les additionne.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "sum(drbd_peerdevice_outofsync_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Divergence réelle confirmée",
      "description": "Paires dont une vérification en ligne, lancée APRÈS une renégociation, a trouvé des blocs réellement divergents entre deux répliques UpToDate. Ce n'est pas un bitmap fantôme : les données diffèrent, et la remédiation automatique ne répare pas cela. Toute valeur non nulle appelle un geste humain — voir DrbdSelfHealDivergenceReelle.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "count(drbd_selfheal_divergence_reelle{resource=~\"$resource\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "dark-red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Resources orphelines",
      "description": "Resources que le noyau porte encore alors que LINSTOR a oublié leur configuration : plus personne ne les réconcilie. Invisibles dans linstor resource list, par définition. Elles restent StandAlone sans quorum et s'opposeront à toute recréation du même nom sur ce nœud. Retrait par drbdsetup down, jamais drbdadm — voir DrbdResourceOrpheline.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "count(drbd_selfheal_resource_orpheline{resource=~\"$resource\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Satellites non scrutés",
      "description": "Satellites prêts que Prometheus ne collecte pas. Un nœud non scruté peut porter un bitmap sale que personne ne voit — le silence ne vaut alors plus preuve de santé.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "(count(kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"piraeus-datastore\", container=\"drbd-reactor\"} == 1) or vector(0)) - (count(drbdreactor_up) or vector(0))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mode du balayeur",
      "description": "En observation, le balayeur détecte, journalise et alerte SANS exécuter aucun drbdadm. Armé, il renégocie lui-même la paire fautive.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_selfheal_dry_run",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "Armé", "color": "blue", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "Observation", "color": "orange", "index": 1 }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": { "match": "null", "result": { "text": "Inconnu", "color": "red", "index": 2 } }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dernier balayage",
      "description": "Âge du dernier verdict. Le cycle est de 5 min : au-delà de 20 min, plus de trois cycles ont été manqués et le balayeur est considéré muet.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "time() - drbd_selfheal_last_run_timestamp_seconds",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "jamais",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 600 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1200 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Interventions (24 h)",
      "description": "Renégociations effectuées par le balayeur. Chaque intervention signale que le défaut de DRBD 9.3.3 s'est reproduit : l'auto-guérison ne doit jamais le masquer.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(drbd_selfheal_actions_total[24h])) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Inventaire",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Paires divergentes — vues depuis le nœud qui porte le bitmap",
      "description": "Un tableau et non un histogramme : la question est « lesquelles », pas « comparer 48 grandeurs ». Le nœud listé est celui d'où il faut agir — c'est lui qui tient le bitmap sale.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_peerdevice_outofsync_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"} > 0",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "container": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "pod": true,
              "peer_node_id": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Nœud (porte le bitmap)",
              "name": "Volume",
              "conn_name": "Pair",
              "volume": "Vol.",
              "Value": "Divergent"
            },
            "indexByName": {}
          }
        },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Divergent", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "filterable": true },
          "noValue": "aucune paire divergente"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Divergent" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "bytes" },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Verdicts du balayeur — progression vers le seuil",
      "description": "Chaque paire suspecte, son défaut, le nombre d'exécutions concordantes et la durée de stagnation réellement PROUVÉE. Les deux conditions doivent être réunies : 2 exécutions et 300 s pour une resync calée, 4 et 900 s pour un bitmap périmé.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_selfheal_streak{resource=~\"$resource\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_selfheal_proven_stagnation_seconds{resource=~\"$resource\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_selfheal_out_of_sync_bytes{resource=~\"$resource\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "container": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "pod": true,
              "service": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Nœud",
              "resource": "Volume",
              "peer": "Pair",
              "volume": "Vol.",
              "defect": "Défaut",
              "Value #A": "Exécutions",
              "Value #B": "Prouvé",
              "Value #C": "Divergent"
            },
            "indexByName": {}
          }
        },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Prouvé", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "filterable": true },
          "noValue": "aucune paire suspecte"
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Prouvé" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Divergent" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "bytes" }] },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Défaut" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "stalled_resync": { "text": "Resync calée", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "stale_bitmap": { "text": "Bitmap périmé", "color": "orange", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Évolution",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bitmap divergent par paire",
      "description": "Une courbe qui ne DESCEND pas est le symptôme : le bitmap ne se purge pas. Elle MONTE sous les écritures applicatives quand la resynchronisation est calée.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_peerdevice_outofsync_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} → {{conn_name}} · {{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic-by-name" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMax": 1
          },
          "noValue": "aucune divergence sur la période"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requêtes de resynchronisation en vol (rs-in-flight)",
      "description": "LE discriminant entre « calée » et « lente ». Une resynchronisation vivante, même bridée, garde des requêtes en vol ; à zéro avec un bitmap non vide, la machine à états ne relance plus rien. Panneau SÉPARÉ du débit : deux grandeurs de sens différent ne partagent pas un axe.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_connection_rsinflight_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"} > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} → {{conn_name}} · {{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic-by-name" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMax": 1
          },
          "noValue": "aucune resynchronisation en cours"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Débit reçu par paire",
      "description": "Dérivée de `received`. Un plateau à zéro pendant qu'un bitmap reste non vide est la signature de la resynchronisation calée. Une remise à zéro du compteur — donc un pic apparent — trahit une reconnexion, c'est-à-dire un battement de rôle.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "rate(drbd_peerdevice_received_bytes{name=~\"$resource\"}[5m]) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} ← {{conn_name}} · {{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic-by-name" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "aucun trafic de réplication"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Garde-fous déclenchés — défaut établi, action refusée",
      "description": "Le balayeur a reconnu un défaut mais s'est interdit d'agir. Ces paires ne se répareront PAS toutes seules : elles relèvent de l'humain. Le quorum est délibérément un garde-fou et non un critère de détection, pour qu'une paire fautive sur un volume sans quorum reste visible ici plutôt que de disparaître.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds}" },
          "expr": "drbd_selfheal_blocked{resource=~\"$resource\"} == 1",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "container": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "namespace": true,
              "pod": true,
              "service": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Nœud",
              "resource": "Volume",
              "peer": "Pair",
              "volume": "Vol.",
              "defect": "Défaut",
              "reason": "Motif du refus"
            },
            "indexByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
